      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[⭐ BerriAI/litellm — The fastest, litest AI Gateway. Rust core with Python SDK. Call 100+ LLM APIs in OpenAI (or native) format with cost tracking, guardrails, load balancing, and logging Bedrock, Azure, OpenAI, Anthropic, OpenAI, VertexAI, vLLM, Nvidia NIM (★95/day)](https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm)**\n_Score: 105_"
